// Title: Execute Code with Pester.bat as Parent
// Rule ID: 18988e1b-9087-4f8a-82fe-0414dce49878
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1216
// Category: process_creation
